  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to cultural heritage monuments of great importance for Cyprus, Phase 8</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to support the reconciliation process and to increase the levels of trust between the two main communities on the island &#x2013; the Greek Cypriots and the Turkish Cypriots. The specific objective is the preservation of Cypriot cultural heritage monuments of great importance, which is pursued through conservation and/or emergency safeguarding works for high importance cultural heritage sites, engagement of communities in the protection and preservation of Cyprus</narrative>
  </description>
